ent-WFMobCarcinomaBurrower = bone burrower
    .desc = A pale, rib-plated thing that tunnels under the bone fields and bites whatever walks overhead.

ent-WFMobCarcinomaSpider = hive spider
    .desc = A meat-red spider that watches from the resin. It was bred here and it knows the hive.

ent-WFMobCarcinomaSlurva = scab slurva
    .desc = A scabby little grazer that works the blood lake shores. It wants nothing from you.


ent-WFVitaeBead = vitae bead
    .desc = A drop of vitae, set like amber. One is only a taste of what the fountain gives.

ent-WFMeatFruit = meat-fruit
    .desc = A glossy red fruit that heals if you eat it. It also sets something growing in the gut; cut it up and bind it on instead.

ent-WFBoneShard = bone shard
    .desc = A splinter of bone with an edge on it. It cuts, barely.

ent-WFCarcinomaVitaeBlister = vitae blister
    .desc = A taut, golden blister of flesh. A clean cut with a blade would drain a bead of vitae from it, and it fills again slowly.

ent-WFCarcinomaBonePile = bone pile
    .desc = A heap of marrow-stained bones with loose, sharp shards in it. You could pull a few free.

ent-WFCarcinomaMeatFruitBush = meat-fruit bush
    .desc = A low, red bush hung with glossy fruit. It is ripe when the fruit is bright.

ent-WFCarcinomaTendonVine = grasping tendon
    .desc = A deep-red strand that looks like the rest of the tendons, and moves more. Don't stand too close.

ent-WFCarcinomaWeepingPolyp = weeping polyp
    .desc = A soft pink polyp that beads blood at the mouth. It opens and breathes out a mist when something comes near.

wf-flora-vine-grabs = A tendon coils round your leg and holds fast!
wf-flora-weeping-polyp-puffs = The polyp opens and breathes a bloody mist over you!
